WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.975
ICAM — beyond accounts.

2
00:00:01.975 --> 00:00:05.875
Credentials: the joiner event
schedules PIV enrollment.

3
00:00:05.875 --> 00:00:09.555
The leaver event blocks sign-in
and revokes sessions first —

4
00:00:09.555 --> 00:00:11.432
Microsoft's documented order,

5
00:00:11.432 --> 00:00:16.464
and the step that closes certificate
sign-in immediately rather than at the next

6
00:00:16.464 --> 00:00:19.093
revocation-list refresh
— then revokes PIV,

7
00:00:19.093 --> 00:00:24.425
derived credentials and device certificates
in parallel, reconciled to completion.

8
00:00:24.425 --> 00:00:29.227
Assurance: record each person's proofing
level and authenticator assurance as

9
00:00:29.227 --> 00:00:33.302
governed attributes, treat missing
proofing evidence as a finding,

10
00:00:33.302 --> 00:00:37.013
and enforce phishing-resistant
MFA under M-22-09.

11
00:00:37.013 --> 00:00:41.494
Access: baseline access derived by
rule from the standard attributes;

12
00:00:41.494 --> 00:00:46.980
position attributes scoping candidates
for privileged eligibility, with explicit

13
00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.066
approval and PIM still required;

14
00:00:49.066 --> 00:00:52.388
and any activity from a
separated person is an alert.

15
00:00:52.388 --> 00:00:55.969
The result: every entitlement
has a "because" — a rule,

16
00:00:55.969 --> 00:00:59.850
an attribute, and the
personnel action that set it.
